</table>
</figure>
<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide a detailed description of the sheet music QA dataset used in our experiments in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix A Dataset Details ‣ Synthesizing Sheet Music Problems for Evaluation and Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. The dataset is designed to evaluate a model’s reasoning ability in sheet music, across two distinct modalities: <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Textual QA</span> and <span id="A1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Visual QA</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The dataset is structured around four core domains of music theory: <span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Scale</span>, <span id="A1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Rhythm</span>, <span id="A1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Interval</span>, and <span id="A1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Chord</span>. It contains a total of 3,200 question-answer pairs, with a balanced distribution of 1,600 questions for each modality. Furthermore, each of the four domains is balanced with 400 questions per modality, ensuring that no single topic is over-represented.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Dataset Distribution</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The precise distribution of questions across all classes and domains is provided in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix A Dataset Details ‣ Synthesizing Sheet Music Problems for Evaluation and Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. The dataset was intentionally balanced at the domain level to ensure robust evaluation across different areas of music theory.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Question Class Descriptions</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below we describe the objective of each question class within the four domains. For Textual QA, the musical context is provided in ABC notation. For Visual QA, the context is a rendered image of standard music notation.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.1 </span>Domain: Scale</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ScaleIdentificationFromAbcQuestion(Scale ID):</span> Given a sequence of notes representing a scale, the model must identify the scale’s name.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 135.62" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 134.24 C 0 135.01 0.62 135.62 1.38 135.62 L 548.62 135.62 C 549.38 135.62 550 135.01 550 134.24 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 134.24 L 548.62 134.24 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="109.24" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Select the most suitable key for the following musical score.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> L:1/4 K:C\n^g ^c d B e e ^c ^f d B ^f a a ^g A A A. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A. A#; B. Ab; C. Am; D. A 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p2.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">D</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ScaleSelectionQuestion(Scale Sel):</span> Given a scale name and a note, the model must determine if the note belongs to that scale.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="233.79" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 233.79" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,233.79) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 232.41 C 0 233.17 0.62 233.79 1.38 233.79 L 548.62 233.79 C 549.38 233.79 550 233.17 550 232.41 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 232.41 L 548.62 232.41 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:14.99em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="207.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 207.4)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Select the correctly written Ebm key with ascending direction.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> None
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">A.</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/4\nK:C\n_E F G _A _B _c _d _e</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">B.</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/4\nK:C\n_e _d _c _B _A _G F _E</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">C.</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/4\nK:C\n_E ^F _G _A _B _c _d _e</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">D.</span> 
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/4\nK:C\n_E F _G _A _B _c _d _e</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS1.p4.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">D</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.2 </span>Domain: Rhythm</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This domain focuses on rhythm, time signatures, and measure structure.
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">TimeSignatureQuestion (Time Sig):</span> Given a complete measure of music, the model must deduce its time signature.
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 135.62" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 134.24 C 0 135.01 0.62 135.62 1.38 135.62 L 548.62 135.62 C 549.38 135.62 550 135.01 550 134.24 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 134.24 L 548.62 134.24 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="109.24" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Select the correct time signature for the music score.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> L:1/8\nK:A\n| efga fedc | c3 d edcd | fedc c2 B2 | E3 G BGEG |
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A. 5/8; B. 4/2; C. 2/2; D. 7/8 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">C</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">BarLinePlacementQuestion (Bar Placement):</span> Given a time signature and an unbarred sequence of notes, the model must identify the correct position for the bar line.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="250.4" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 250.4" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,250.4) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 249.01 C 0 249.78 0.62 250.4 1.38 250.4 L 548.62 250.4 C 549.38 250.4 550 249.78 550 249.01 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 249.01 L 548.62 249.01 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:16.19em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="224.01" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 224.01)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Based on the time signature, which option correctly places the bar lines for the given sequence of notes?
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nM:3/4\nK:F\nf4 F2 g2 gg gg g4 G2 a2 ba gf
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I2" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">A.</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nM:3/4\nK:F\n| f4 F2 g2 gg gg g4 | G2 a2 ba gf |</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">B.</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nM:3/4\nK:F\n| f4 F2 | g2 gg gg | g4 G2 | a2 ba gf |</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">C.</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nM:3/4\nK:F\n| f4 F2 g2 gg gg | g4 G2 a2 ba gf |</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">D.</span> 
<span id="A1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nM:3/4\nK:F\n| f4 F2 g2 | gg gg g4 | G2 a2 ba gf |</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p4.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">B</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.3 </span>Domain: Interval</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This domain tests the ability to identify and construct intervals between notes.
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">IntervalNumberQuestion (Interval No):</span> Given two notes, the model must identify the interval between them.
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="152.23" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 152.23" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,152.23) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 150.85 C 0 151.61 0.62 152.23 1.38 152.23 L 548.62 152.23 C 549.38 152.23 550 151.61 550 150.85 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 150.85 L 548.62 150.85 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:9.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="125.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 125.84)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Given two notes with their ABC scores, select the correct name of the interval between them.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nM:2/2\nK:A\nB b2
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A. perfect octave; B. perfect unison; C. major third; D. major seventh 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">NoteCompletionByInterval (Note Comp):</span> Given a starting note and an interval, the model must identify the resulting note.
<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="250.4" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 250.4" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,250.4) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 249.01 C 0 249.78 0.62 250.4 1.38 250.4 L 548.62 250.4 C 549.38 250.4 550 249.78 550 249.01 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 249.01 L 548.62 249.01 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:16.19em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="224.01" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 224.01)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Select correct note to make the following note in music score form the major third interval.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> L:1/16\nM:2/4\nK:G\nG
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I3" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A1.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">A.</span> 
<span id="A1.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/16\nM:2/4\nK:G\nG b</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">B.</span> 
<span id="A1.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/16\nM:2/4\nK:G\nG d</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">C.</span> 
<span id="A1.I3.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/16\nM:2/4\nK:G\nG D</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I3.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">D.</span> 
<span id="A1.I3.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I3.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I3.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">L:1/16\nM:2/4\nK:G\nG B</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS3.p4.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">D</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.2.4 </span>Domain: Chord</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This domain assesses knowledge of chord structure, identification, and composition.
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ChordsCompletionQuestion (Chord Comp):</span> Given two notes of a standard triad, the model must provide the missing third note.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="233.79" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 233.79" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,233.79) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 232.41 C 0 233.17 0.62 233.79 1.38 233.79 L 548.62 233.79 C 549.38 233.79 550 233.17 550 232.41 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 232.41 L 548.62 232.41 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:14.99em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="207.4" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 207.4)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Given several notes, select the correct Note to form a B augmented chord.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> K:C\nL:1/4\n[B^f]
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.I4" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A1.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">A.</span> 
<span id="A1.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">K:C\nL:1/4\n[B^f^f]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">B.</span> 
<span id="A1.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">K:C\nL:1/4\n[B^ff]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">C.</span> 
<span id="A1.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">K:C\nL:1/4\n[B^fe]</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A1.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">D.</span> 
<span id="A1.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I4.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">K:C\nL:1/4\n[B^f^d]</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p2.pic1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">D</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ChordKeyRootIdentificationQuestion (Chord Root ID):</span> Given a chord, the model must identify its root note.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 135.62" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 134.24 C 0 135.01 0.62 135.62 1.38 135.62 L 548.62 135.62 C 549.38 135.62 550 135.01 550 134.24 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 134.24 L 548.62 134.24 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="109.24" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Identify the correct root note of the chord in the following sheet music.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> K:C#m\nL:1/4\n[BdG]
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A. G; B. d#; C. G#; D. d 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p4.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">C</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ChordIdentificationQuestion (Chord ID):</span> Given a set of notes, the model must identify the full name of the chord.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="135.62" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 135.62" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,135.62) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 134.24 C 0 135.01 0.62 135.62 1.38 135.62 L 548.62 135.62 C 549.38 135.62 550 135.01 550 134.24 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 134.24 L 548.62 134.24 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 13.19)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="109.24" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Select the correct chord name based on the following music sheet.
<br class="ltx_break"></span>ABC_context:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> K:C\nL:1/4\n[F_Ac]
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Choice:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">A. Fdim; B. Abm; C. F; D. Fm 
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Ground_truth:<span id="A1.SS2.SSS4.p6.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">D</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Data Format</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Each sample in the dataset is a JSON object containing the unique identifier, modality, domain, question class, context, question, and the ground-truth answer. An example of a data point for the Textual QA modality is shown below.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="206.27" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 206.27" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,206.27) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 204.89 C 0 205.65 0.62 206.27 1.38 206.27 L 548.62 206.27 C 549.38 206.27 550 205.65 550 204.89 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 204.89 L 548.62 204.89 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 16.65)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:12.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="179.88" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 176.42)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{
<br class="ltx_break">   "class_name": "TimeSignatureQuestion",
<br class="ltx_break">   "question": "Select the correct time signature for the music score.", 
<br class="ltx_break">   "abc_context": "L:1/8\nQ:1/4=120\nK:C\n| c3 c B2 G2 | A2 G2 TF3 E | E4 z2 G2 | A2 B2 c3 c |",
<br class="ltx_break">   "correct_answer": "2/2", 
<br class="ltx_break">   "incorrect_answer1": "9/8", 
<br class="ltx_break">   "incorrect_answer2": "12/8", 
<br class="ltx_break">   "incorrect_answer3": "7/8",
<br class="ltx_break">   "category": "Beat",
<br class="ltx_break">}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For the Visual QA modality, the "context" field would contain a path to the corresponding image file (e.g., <span id="A1.SS3.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"image/visual-chords-0044.png"</span>).</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Training Template</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">All trained models employ an identical system prompt during both training and inference.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="72.67" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 72.67" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,72.67) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.38 L 0 71.28 C 0 72.05 0.62 72.67 1.38 72.67 L 548.62 72.67 C 549.38 72.67 550 72.05 550 71.28 L 550 1.38 C 550 0.62 549.38 0 548.62 0 L 1.38 0 C 0.62 0 0 0.62 0 1.38 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EEE5F8;" fill="#EEE5F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 1.38 L 1.38 71.28 L 548.62 71.28 L 548.62 1.38 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.07 16.65)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.7em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="46.28" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.82)" width="507.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.7em;">
<span id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You FIRST think about the reasoning process as an internal monologue and then provide the final answer. The reasoning process MUST BE enclosed within <code id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;think&gt;</code> <code id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;/think&gt;</code> tags. The final answer MUST BE put in <code id="A2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter">\boxed{}</code>.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</article>
